<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Argentaria 96 attributable seen off 56pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Argentaria 96 attributable seen off 56pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank Argentaria. Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    194.62     204.90    192.89 - 197.40</p>
<p>    Operating income	  41.48	86.35     41.00 - 41.85</p>
<p>    Net attributable	  32.61	74.20     29.10 - 34.07</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)		265	  591	  235 - 278</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>Argentaria is expected to release its results on January 24.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
